      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 3262412965971147974, guid: 0efec6e396faf874391cde3fa7802294, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue1.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey there! What do you think of my garden? Isn't it lovely?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: I'm an expert when it comes to growing purple flowers and purple flowers
        only.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: I tried growing a red flower, but it ended up starting a fire.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[3]'
      value: Luckily, no one was injured, so I got off scott free!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: Just a warning, do not try to eat the purple flowers. It will end badly.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: I put them in a salad and gave it to my friend, and they began vomitting
        like crazy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: Luckily, they recovered quickly, so I got off scott free.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5614111530991891237, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC (1)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
