      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue1.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Hey, you here for the Lucky Numbers Fesitival? It''s all that''s going
        on right now. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: A fun quirk of the festival is that all houses must have their doors
        open while the festival is ongoing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: So feel free to barge into any house you see and talk to everyone. No
        one can stop you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hmm? Where's my house? Good question.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: It got repossessed. Apparently, missing payments is a crime these days.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5571950841072699475, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: Ah well. You win some, you lose some. And I'm still trying to win something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5614111530991891237, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: c2f25f6591d68bd48ad1ff3b6a93b501, type: 3}
